# Never commit state or secrets.
#
# `data/` holds providers.json (API keys), chats.json (every conversation) and
# settings.json. `workspace/` holds whatever the agent has written. Both are the
# operator's own data, both are machine-specific, and providers.json alone is
# enough to spend someone's API quota.
data/
workspace/
tool-rejects.log
last-rejected-files.json

# Test scratch: suites write into these and they change on every run.
.smoke/data/
.smoke/workspace/
.smoke/workspace-*/

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.log

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.kilo/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
